    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds real nice in theory, but it feels like just a way to delay the inevitable. i'm not looking for a \"spirit\" to protect, i'm looking for peace. it feels like every second i wait is just another second of terror and waiting for someone to come through that door. wouldn't it be more dignified to just decide how things end on my own terms, before the chaos gets to me? is there anything more human than taking back that one last bit of control?",
